    f"- GitLab: API returned HTTP 401 invalid_token (token expired).\n"
    f"- Logs saved at /workspace/owncloud_search_log.txt\n\n"
    f"Next steps: please review the Plane issues and either re-upload the missing files to OwnCloud or 
